OL,3,GNEWSAThe murder of a journalist 25
OL,4,Ayears on - why has no one been caught?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe brother of a journalist, who was
OL,7,Fshot dead as he walked home with his
OL,8,Fwife, says if he did not continue to
OL,9,Ffight for answers around the murder
OL,10,F"the guilt would kill me".
OL,12,FEarlier this week marked the 25th
OL,13,Fanniversary of the 2001 murder of
OL,14,Finvestigative reporter Martin O'Hagan.
OL,16,FThe 51-year-old died in Lurgan, County
OL,17,FArmagh, and was shot when walking home
OL,18,Ffrom a pub - a killing that was claimed
OL,19,Fby the Red Hand Defenders, a cover name
OL,20,Fused by both the Loyalist Volunteer
OL,21,FForce and Ulster Defence Association.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
